{"id":39522,"date":"2025-01-06T08:09:19","date_gmt":"2025-01-06T07:09:19","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/meia-maratona-lisboa-2025-ponte-vasco-da-gama\/"},"modified":"2026-08-21T00:01:33","modified_gmt":"2026-08-20T23:01:33","slug":"meia-maratona-lisboa-2025-ponte-vasco-da-gama","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/meia-maratona-lisboa-2025-ponte-vasco-da-gama\/","title":{"rendered":"Meia Maratona Lisboa 2025 &#8211; Ponte Vasco da Gama"},"content":{"rendered":"<div class=\"pr-expired-notice\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.15) 0%, rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.6) 100%); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.35); border-radius: 16px; padding: 18px 24px; margin-bottom: 24px; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 16px;\"><div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex: 1; min-width: 260px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">\ud83c\udfc3\u200d\u2642\ufe0f<\/span><div><strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 15px; font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif;\">Esta edi\u00e7\u00e3o j\u00e1 decorreu.<\/strong><p style=\"font-size: 13.5px; color: #CBD5E1; margin: 2px 0 0 0;\">Consulta os resultados desta prova abaixo ou acede a todos os detalhes da edi\u00e7\u00e3o atual.<\/p><\/div><\/div><a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/meia-maratona-lisboa-ponte-vasco-da-gama\/\" style=\"background: #8B5CF6 !important; color: #FFFFFF !important; font-weight: 700 !important; font-size: 13.5px !important; text-decoration: none !important; padding: 11px 22px !important; border-radius: 10px !important; white-space: nowrap !important; display: inline-flex !important; align-items: center !important; justify-content: center !important; height: 42px !important; margin: 0 !important; border: none !important; line-height: 1 !important; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.4) !important;\">Ver Edi\u00e7\u00e3o Atual &rarr;<\/a><\/div>\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">A Hyundai Meia Maratonaa \u00e9 uma das mais populares provas de Portugal e em 2024 realizar-se a <strong>26  de Outubro<\/strong>. O seu percurso de 21 Km tem in\u00edcio na&nbsp;Ponte Vasco da Gama&nbsp;terminando na&nbsp;Pra\u00e7a do Com\u00e9rcio, um marco hist\u00f3rico da cidade de Lisboa, em frente ao rio Tejo.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><a href=\"https:\/\/results.sporthive.com\/events\/7250558163252939008\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Resultados 2025<\/a><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><a href=\"https:\/\/results.sporthive.com\/events\/7142910812398577664\/races\/487971\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Resultados 2024<\/a><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">A Hyundai Meia Maratona, ocorre no mesmo dia da\u00a0Maratona de Lisboa, que em conjunto, trazem todos os anos \u00e0 cidade os grandes nomes do atletismo nacional e internacional e atraem milhares de corredores estrangeiros, que juntam o prazer da corrida com a visita a uma cidade \u00fanica como Lisboa.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Percurso <\/h2>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"634\" src=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/12\/Meia-Maratona-de-Lisboa-2023-Percurso-1024x634.jpg\" alt=\"Meia Maratona de Lisboa 2023 - Percurso\" class=\"wp-image-26697\" title=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/12\/Meia-Maratona-de-Lisboa-2023-Percurso-1024x634.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/12\/Meia-Maratona-de-Lisboa-2023-Percurso-300x186.jpg 300w, https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/12\/Meia-Maratona-de-Lisboa-2023-Percurso-768x476.jpg 768w, https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/12\/Meia-Maratona-de-Lisboa-2023-Percurso.jpg 1130w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">VIDEO DA PROVA de 2022<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\n<iframe title=\"Atletismo: Meia e Mini Maratona de Lisboa - 09\/10\/2022\" width=\"800\" height=\"450\" src=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/embed\/XNISNhO6LJI?feature=oembed\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen><\/iframe>\n<\/div><\/figure>\n\n\n<div id=\"rank-math-faq\" class=\"rank-math-block\">\n<div class=\"rank-math-list \">\n<div id=\"faq-question-1689069917123\" class=\"rank-math-list-item\">\n<h3 class=\"rank-math-question \">Quando \u00e9 a Meia Maratona de Lisboa da Ponte Vasco da Gama?<\/h3>\n<div class=\"rank-math-answer \">\n\n<p>A pr\u00f3xima Meia Maratona de Lisboa \u00e9 a 26 de outubro.<\/p>\n\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div id=\"faq-question-1689070013006\" class=\"rank-math-list-item\">\n<h3 class=\"rank-math-question \">Onde termina a Meia Maratona de Lisboa?<br><\/h3>\n<div class=\"rank-math-answer \">\n\n<p>A meia maratona vai terminar na Pra\u00e7a do Com\u00e9rcio.<\/p>\n\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":39523,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[27,41],"event_type_2":[33,727],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5":[],"class_list":["post-39522","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-lisboa","event_type-corrida","event_type-meiamaratona","event_type_2-lisboa","event_type_2-lisboa-e-centro"],"acf":[],"featured_image_src":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/01\/Meia-Ma